# caption: Apply an imported effect contract conservatively.

REQUIRE call, current analysis facts, trusted or conservatively inferred summary
ENSURE retained facts remain valid after every allowed behavior
expand the summary to include permitted callback effects
invalidate memory facts overlapping possible writes
mark retained references as escaped under the ownership policy
preserve required exceptional and nonreturning control paths
keep only facts justified by the complete summary

